{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4QQR9tAmzM8RKhDdax","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The door stands before you — ancient oak, iron-banded, weathered by centuries of hands pressing against its grain.*\n\n*A keyhole glints dully at its center, shaped like a question waiting to be completed.*\n\n*You hold a key. But which key? The door has known ten thousand keys. Most were wrong. Some were right but turned too late. A few opened doors that should have stayed shut.*\n\n*Insert the key?*\n\n*The lock waits. The tumblers dream of alignment.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":114,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}